# Six Eyes template

- Read `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` for routing.
- Skills live under `.claude/skills/` — invoke by skill name; do not duplicate skill bodies here.
- Outbound writes (Slack send, Jira/Confluence mutate) require explicit human approval; drafts only.
- Warehouse prompts: respect `config/context/*.yaml` injected by hooks.
- Example company is **Acme** (subscription app); keep all example content fictional and domain-neutral.
